        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>So the Slaughterhouse 6 cards are confusing me.</p><p>some refer to &quot;nemesis cards.&quot; &nbsp;Some refers to &quot;cards with nemesis icons,&quot; and Ray Manta&#39;s card says &quot;each nemesis.&quot;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>which is what? Which ones include character cards, and which don&#39;t?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>does Glamour redirect damage targeting Villain Character cards? Who does hunting pack heal (this one seems pretty clear, but I want to make sure)? If Omni-X is in the game and components are out, who is healed by Ray Manta?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>thnaks!</p>",
