        "id": 153947,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-22T15:48:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>\"Nemesis cards\" and \"Nemesis\" are those with Nemesis as a keyword.&nbsp;<span>\"Cards with a nemesis icons\" are any cards with a nemesis icon on the card.</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span>Edit: Enticing Target would redirect damage from any Villain Character Card, as they all have nemesis icons, along with cards with the nemesis keyword, as they also have a nemesis icon.&nbsp;</span></p>",
        "post_number": 2,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:33:21.968Z",
