        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/matchstickman/{size}/1880_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-22T15:56:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Cards with Nemesis Icons are any card that includes a Nemesis Icon, including Hero and Villain Character Cards.</p><p>Nemesis cards are cards with the word Nemesis in the \"descriptive\" box (where Ongoing would be).</p><p>Ray Manta is referring to the same thing, again as if the instructions was \"All Ongoings\".</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>EDIT: I did not know we were in the Temple of Zhu Long!</p>",
